@host = http://localhost:5099

### Swagger
GET {{host}}/swagger

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Pass123$",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Pass123$"
}

### Get Foods
GET {{host}}/api/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}